up.com/edited-volume/62239?login=true\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '68917900',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Oxford Research Encyclopedia of Politics\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>One of a series of <strong>Oxford Research Encyclopedias</strong>, presenting peer-reviewed articles on a wide range of topics, such as Anthropology, Business and Management, Climate Science, Communication, Criminology, Economics, Education, Global Public Health, History, Linguistics, Literature, Planetary Science, Politics, Psychology and Religion.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://search.proquest.com/pais/advanced?accountid=14512\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5618264',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                PAIS Index\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>International coverage of articles, books, conference proceedings, and government documents on social and political policy, political science, public administration, current affairs, and related topics from 1972 to the present. Includes PAIS Archive, which covers 1915 to 1976.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://congressional.proquest.com/congressional/search/basic/basicsearch\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5618347',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                ProQuest Congressional\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>Contains full text of bills, resolutions, hearings, debates, and other legislative documents. Also contains Congressional Research Service (CRS) reports, Serial Set, and legislative histories (through Legislative Insight). UCLA doesn't have access to all content on the platform.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://trid.trb.org/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5618623',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                TRID (Transport Research International Documentation)\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">Transportation database that combines the records from US TRB's Transportation Research Information Services (TRIS) and the OECD Joint Transport Research Centre's International Transport Research Documentation (ITRD). TRID provides access to over 1.4 million records of transportation research worldwide.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div><div id=\"s-lg-sb-name-regular\" class=\"s-lg-db-panel\"><div class=\"s-lg-db-panel-title\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\">Additional Databases</div><div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://www.poverty.amdigital.co.uk/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '53532794',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Poverty, Philanthropy and Social Conditions in Victorian Britain\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>Comprised of collections from The National Archives at Kew, the British Library and Senate House Library, this database navigates the complex social climate of nineteenth and early twentieth-century Britain between the introduction of the New Poor Law in 1834 and the eventual abolition of the workhouse system in 1930.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","experts":"<div class=\"margin-bottom-xlg\"><div class=\"s-lib-public-side-header\"><h2 class=\"pad-bottom-sm\">Public Affairs Experts</h2></div><div class=\"txt pad-top-sm\"><div class=\"s-lib-featured-profile-spacer clearfix\"></div><div class=\"s-lib-featured-profile-container\"><a href=\"https://guides.library.ucla.edu/prf.php?id=4d24d3bd-2733-11ee-8db8-127d3674933b\"><div class=\"s-lib-featured-profile-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/accounts/365668/profiles/373975/KelseyBrownHeadshot.jpeg\" alt=\"Photograph of librarian Kelsey Brown\" /></div><div class=\"s-lib-profile-div s-lib-featured-profile-name\">Kelsey Brown</div></a></div><div class=\"s-lib-featured-profile-container\"><a href=\"https://guides.library.ucla.edu/prf.php?id=58e5a31d-7cdb-11ed-9922-0ad758b798c3\"><div class=\"s-lib-featured-profile-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/accounts/32595/profiles/27014/akh_newish.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div><div class=\"s-lib-profile-div s-lib-featured-profile-name\">Angela Horne</div></a></div></div></div>","blog_posts":"<div class=\"pull-left\"><h2 class=\"muted\">No blog posts have been assigned to this subject.</h2></div>","er_courses":"","rows":1},"version":"x.x"}